# Preset - Modern Open Source Business Intelligence

> Preset is a fully managed cloud service for Apache Superset, the leading open source BI and data visualization platform.

## About Preset

Preset provides enterprise-grade business intelligence powered by Apache Superset. We offer:
- **Preset Cloud**: Fully-managed, cloud-hosted Apache Superset service
- **Managed Private Cloud**: Preset with additional security in your private cloud (AWS, GCP, Azure)
- **Preset Certified Superset**: Deploy QA-approved Superset on any infrastructure
- **Embedded Dashboards**: Interactive analytics embedded in your custom applications
- **Preset API**: Manage your Preset workspaces as code

## Key Features

- SQL Lab for ad-hoc data exploration
- 40+ pre-installed visualizations
- Drag-and-drop chart and dashboard creation
- Dashboard filters and cross-filtering
- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and Row Level Security (RLS)
- SSO/SAML authentication
- Slack and email alerts & reports
- SOC 2 Type II compliant

## Supported Data Sources

Preset connects to most SQL datasources including:
- Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift, Databricks
- PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, Oracle
- Trino, Presto, Druid, ClickHouse
- Athena, DuckDB, TimescaleDB
- And 40+ more database engines

## Use Cases

1. **Business Intelligence (BI)**: Analytics and visualizations for modern data stacks
2. **Internal Tooling**: Embedded analytics for your organization
3. **Customer-facing Apps**: Embedded analytics for your customers
4. **AI-driven Analytics**: Conversational AI chatbot (Dot) and MCP service for natural language insights

## Trust & Compliance

- SOC 2 Type II certified
- PCI-DSS Level 2 compliant
- **HIPAA compliant**: Secure analytics for protected health information (PHI) - https://preset.io/hipaa-compliance/
- Trust & Security overview: https://preset.io/trust-and-security/

